    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>Any material used to protect, cushion, or brace objects for safe shipment or storage. For packing material that carries information or otherwise conveys a message about the product, use "packaging." [Source: Getty AAT]</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
